[Name] Gnome-Desktop
[Summary] GNOME desktop library (gnome-desktop-4)
[Description] gnome-desktop is the GNOME desktop library used by Mutter, GNOME Shell, and many apps. Mutter 48+ requires gnome-desktop-4 >= 44. Build AFTER GLib 2.84 + gsettings-desktop-schemas 48 + JSON-GLib 1.10 + GdkPixbuf 2.42 + GSettings-Desktop-Schemas 48 and BEFORE Mutter. Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
